[{"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b53b/3a3d/55_large.png?m=1726310276", "name": "games", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b53b/3a3d/55_normal.png?m=1726310276", "title": "游戏", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/games", "topics": 3436, "footer": "", "header": "Life is short, have more fun.", "title_alternative": "Games", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b53b/3a3d/55_mini.png?m=1726310276", "stars": 2635, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 55, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 448693, "username": "reoah2", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/reoah2", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_mini.png?m=1787116927", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_normal.png?m=1787116927", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_large.png?m=1787116927", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_xlarge.png?m=1787116927", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cfd5/a9c8/448693_xxlarge.png?m=1787116927", "created": 1571822484, "last_modified": 1787116927, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "V2WT", "last_touched": 1793635145, "title": "没有人讨论影之刃零吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253638", "created": 1793580806, "deleted": 0, "content": "我周末已经玩到天昏地暗不知时间为何物了，无心上班想请假回去继续打", "content_rendered": "我周末已经玩到天昏地暗不知时间为何物了，无心上班想请假回去继续打", "last_modified": 1793580806, "replies": 168, "id": 1253638}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 12033, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2544, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 707821, "username": "zzwww", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/zzwww", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_mini.png?m=1788144246", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_normal.png?m=1788144246", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_large.png?m=1788144246", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_xlarge.png?m=1788144246", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_xxlarge.png?m=1788144246", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9c42/37b4/707821_xxxlarge.png?m=1788144246", "created": 1724808152, "last_modified": 1788144246, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Aliclia", "last_touched": 1793636566, "title": "你们除了上班 娱乐方式有哪些", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253690", "created": 1793585717, "deleted": 0, "content": "周末有时候无聊到甚至想上班，  游戏不想打，  在家躺着心里都有点焦虑，  想去做点什么又不知道做什么，  你们休息一般做点什么呢？", "content_rendered": "<p>周末有时候无聊到甚至想上班，  游戏不想打，  在家躺着心里都有点焦虑，  想去做点什么又不知道做什么，  你们休息一般做点什么呢？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1793586978, "replies": 168, "id": 1253690}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24724, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3756, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 32079, "username": "losephsky", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/losephsky", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3d61/b198/32079_mini.png?m=1793603417", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3d61/b198/32079_normal.png?m=1793603417", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3d61/b198/32079_large.png?m=1793603417", "created": 1357799917, "last_modified": 1793603417, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "iceheart", "last_touched": 1793651531, "title": "前公司老板找我回去救场，情况比较特殊，想听听各位的建议", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253836", "created": 1793604456, "deleted": 0, "content": "# 求助：前老板邀约回去救场，想请教大家风险和谈判要点\r\n各位好，想咨询下大家的经验。\r\n\r\n## 背景\r\n我是技术出身的产品经理，之前一手搭建整套产研团队，负责的产品已经多端稳定上线。一个月前正常离职，交接工作当时处理得比较完整。\r\n现在前老板联系我，说产研团队军心涣散、普遍摆烂，项目和系统已经接近系统性崩溃，希望我回去接手稳住局面。\r\n\r\n## 核心顾虑/风险点\r\n1. 公司之前存在晚发薪资+月底缴纳社保的记录；\r\n2. 团队制度近期变动：调整为单休、强抓考勤、新增 KPI ，内部氛围偏向变相倒逼员工主动离职；\r\n3. 角色尴尬：回去后大概率要当“背锅+坏人”，需要推动整改、梳理问题、压进度，很容易和老部下、现有同事形成对立。\r\n\r\n我对之前带出来的团队和产品有感情，但不想踩坑。想请教大家：\r\n\r\n如果考虑回去，在**谈条件、权责边界、劳动合同、风险隔离、团队沟通、止损预案**这些方面，有哪些必须提前敲定、重点留意的事项？\r\n另外也想听听大家判断：这种局面本身值不值得接？\r\n\r\n感谢各位分享经验。", "content_rendered": "<h1>求助：前老板邀约回去救场，想请教大家风险和谈判要点</h1>\n<p>各位好，想咨询下大家的经验。</p>\n<h2>背景</h2>\n<p>我是技术出身的产品经理，之前一手搭建整套产研团队，负责的产品已经多端稳定上线。一个月前正常离职，交接工作当时处理得比较完整。\n现在前老板联系我，说产研团队军心涣散、普遍摆烂，项目和系统已经接近系统性崩溃，希望我回去接手稳住局面。</p>\n<h2>核心顾虑/风险点</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>公司之前存在晚发薪资+月底缴纳社保的记录；</li>\n<li>团队制度近期变动：调整为单休、强抓考勤、新增 KPI ，内部氛围偏向变相倒逼员工主动离职；</li>\n<li>角色尴尬：回去后大概率要当“背锅+坏人”，需要推动整改、梳理问题、压进度，很容易和老部下、现有同事形成对立。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>我对之前带出来的团队和产品有感情，但不想踩坑。想请教大家：</p>\n<p>如果考虑回去，在<strong>谈条件、权责边界、劳动合同、风险隔离、团队沟通、止损预案</strong>这些方面，有哪些必须提前敲定、重点留意的事项？\n另外也想听听大家判断：这种局面本身值不值得接？</p>\n<p>感谢各位分享经验。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1793604456, "replies": 166, "id": 1253836}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242743, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4545, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 18392, "username": "revival83", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/revival83", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "北京", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_mini.png?m=1755746557", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_normal.png?m=1755746557", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_large.png?m=1755746557", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_xlarge.png?m=1755746557", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_xxlarge.png?m=1755746557", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2b48/30a2/18392_xxxlarge.png?m=1755746557", "created": 1332135411, "last_modified": 1755746557, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "CallmeDredd", "last_touched": 1793634995, "title": "兄弟们这辈子买过的最贵的东西是什么？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253707", "created": 1793587661, "deleted": 0, "content": "除了房子、看病、养娃，摸得到的实物", "content_rendered": "除了房子、看病、养娃，摸得到的实物", "last_modified": 1793587661, "replies": 135, "id": 1253707}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 12033, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2544, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 512839, "username": "space2020", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/space2020", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_mini.png?m=1787107512", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_normal.png?m=1787107512", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_large.png?m=1787107512", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_xlarge.png?m=1787107512", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_xxlarge.png?m=1787107512", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9d6/8807/512839_xxxlarge.png?m=1787107512", "created": 1602686375, "last_modified": 1787107512, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "chengzigua", "last_touched": 1793642867, "title": "大家现在每天早餐消费多少钱？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253673", "created": 1793584630, "deleted": 0, "content": "我是上班时吃一个和善园肉包 2.5 ，周末起不来就不吃了", "content_rendered": "我是上班时吃一个和善园肉包 2.5 ，周末起不来就不吃了", "last_modified": 1793584630, "replies": 122, "id": 1253673}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 242743, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4545, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 755662, "username": "LessWu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/LessWu", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/945a812622b7ec505d599bc32eddb40a?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/945a812622b7ec505d599bc32eddb40a?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/945a812622b7ec505d599bc32eddb40a?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1751538680, "last_modified": 1763606448, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "kkwa56188", "last_touched": 1793651075, "title": "朋友一家定期献血，我看着矿泉水瓶陷入了沉思", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253782", "created": 1793599009, "deleted": 0, "content": "有个朋友在血站工作，听他说，他们家里人都会定期献血。\r\n\r\n这让我有点好奇：以前听人说，定期献血能促进造血，让血液“更新”，对身体有好处；也有人觉得，献血会让身体变虚，需要很久才能恢复。\r\n\r\n这两种说法到底哪个更靠谱？\r\n\r\n我自己一想到一次献血 400 毫升，就有点发怵——差不多是一瓶 500 毫升矿泉水的八成。想象一下从身体里抽出这么多血，总觉得自己可能会头晕 😂\r\n\r\n你献过血吗？一次献了多少？", "content_rendered": "<p>有个朋友在血站工作，听他说，他们家里人都会定期献血。</p>\n<p>这让我有点好奇：以前听人说，定期献血能促进造血，让血液“更新”，对身体有好处；也有人觉得，献血会让身体变虚，需要很久才能恢复。</p>\n<p>这两种说法到底哪个更靠谱？</p>\n<p>我自己一想到一次献血 400 毫升，就有点发怵——差不多是一瓶 500 毫升矿泉水的八成。想象一下从身体里抽出这么多血，总觉得自己可能会头晕 😂</p>\n<p>你献过血吗？一次献了多少？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1793599009, "replies": 122, "id": 1253782}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 74247, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9817, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 669953, "username": "webhub123", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/webhub123", "website": "https://www.webhub123.com/#/home/more", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8ac/f1cf/669953_mini.png?m=1793586732", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8ac/f1cf/669953_normal.png?m=1793586732", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8ac/f1cf/669953_large.png?m=1793586732", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8ac/f1cf/669953_xlarge.png?m=1793586732", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8ac/f1cf/669953_xxlarge.png?m=1793586732", "created": 1704448489, "last_modified": 1793586732, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Thiece", "last_touched": 1793641246, "title": "agent 的代码到底审不审核", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253699", "created": 1793586809, "deleted": 0, "content": "用 claude code 写的代码\r\n```\r\n# 子集聚合全部改成掩码列，取代循环里的 kills/killed/npc/rev/paid 五次切片\r\n    d[\"_paid\"] = ((d[\"is_revive\"] == 1) & (d[\"irevivemoney\"] > 0)).astype(int)\r\n    d[\"_kill_tgt\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_kill\"] == 1)\r\n    d[\"_killed_src\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_killed_by_role\"] == 1)\r\n    d[\"_rev_type\"] = d[\"irevivetype\"].where(d[\"is_revive\"] == 1)\r\n    d[\"_paid_money\"] = d[\"irevivemoney\"].where(d[\"_paid\"] == 1)\r\n    d[\"_red\"] = (utils.to_num(d[\"ikilledred\"]).fillna(0) if has_killedred\r\n                 else pd.Series(0.0, index=d.index))\r\n    gb = d.groupby(\"roleid\", sort=False)\r\n```\r\n全是这样的，完全看不懂！但是让 agent 讲解一看，确实又高效又简洁，但是很难看懂啊。到底审还是不审核", "content_rendered": "<p>用 claude code 写的代码</p>\n<pre><code># 子集聚合全部改成掩码列，取代循环里的 kills/killed/npc/rev/paid 五次切片\n    d[\"_paid\"] = ((d[\"is_revive\"] == 1) &amp; (d[\"irevivemoney\"] &gt; 0)).astype(int)\n    d[\"_kill_tgt\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_kill\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_killed_src\"] = d[\"votherroleid\"].where(d[\"is_killed_by_role\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_rev_type\"] = d[\"irevivetype\"].where(d[\"is_revive\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_paid_money\"] = d[\"irevivemoney\"].where(d[\"_paid\"] == 1)\n    d[\"_red\"] = (utils.to_num(d[\"ikilledred\"]).fillna(0) if has_killedred\n                 else pd.Series(0.0, index=d.index))\n    gb = d.groupby(\"roleid\", sort=False)\n</code></pre>\n<p>全是这样的，完全看不懂！但是让 agent 讲解一看，确实又高效又简洁，但是很难看懂啊。到底审还是不审核</p>\n", "last_modified": 1793586809, "replies": 118, "id": 1253699}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/1fc2/1400/864_large.png?m=1778522847", "name": "promotions", "avatar_norma