e": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 5094, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3430, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 23281, "username": "tcper", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/tcper", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9691/dfa0/23281_mini.png?m=1742395010", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9691/dfa0/23281_normal.png?m=1742395010", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9691/dfa0/23281_large.png?m=1742395010", "created": 1341842779, "last_modified": 1742395010, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "zerovoid", "last_touched": 1793647310, "title": "AI 普及之后，应该把所有 Electron 重写为 native", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1253744", "created": 1793591129, "deleted": 0, "content": "凡是基于 Electron 开发的，开着时间长，必然内存占用越来越大，界面响应越来越慢\r\n\r\n以前大家手写不挑你理，既然 AI 让写代码成本降低了\r\n\r\n感觉第一件事就应该全部迁移为 native\r\n\r\n大不了 macos/windows 各写一套呗，相同业务逻辑", "content_rendered": "<p>凡是基于 Electron 开发的，开着时间长，必然内存占用越来越大，界面响应越来越慢</p>\n<p>以前大家手写不挑你理，既然 AI 让写代码成本降低了</p>\n<p>感觉第一件事就应该全部迁移为 native</p>\n<p>大不了 macos/windows 各写一套呗，相同业务逻辑</p>\n", "last_modified": 1793591186, "replies": 70, "id": 1253744}]